<Base title="Terms · AutoDeck" description="The terms for using AutoDeck services, bookings and memberships." page="terms">
  <section class="phero"><div class="wrap">
    <p class="eyebrow">Legal</p>
    <h1>Terms</h1>
    <p class="lede">Last updated 18 October 2026. These terms cover use of the AutoDeck website and app, bookings and Club plans.</p>
  </div></section>
  <section class="s" style="padding-top:40px"><div class="wrap" style="max-width:760px;display:grid;gap:22px">
    <div><h3>Who we are</h3><p>AutoDeck is a sole proprietorship of Shalin Sheth, at Sunbeam Complex, Old Sharda Mandir Rd, Ellisbridge, Ahmedabad, Gujarat 380006 (Udyam UDYAM-GJ-01-0693147). "We" and "the studio" mean AutoDeck. The app lets you book car care, follow your car's visit, keep papers and buy a Club plan.</p></div>
    <div><h3>Your account</h3><p>You sign in with your Google account. Keep it to yourself. Give correct details for you and your car. You must own the car, or have the owner's permission, to book work on it.</p></div>
    <div><h3>Bookings</h3><p>A booking is a request for a slot. The price shown is what we confirm at booking and on your invoice. If your car needs something that is not in the booking, we tell you first and do it only after you approve. Some work (body, paint, coatings and film) is priced after we inspect the car. The final price is confirmed after inspection.</p></div>
    <div><h3>Changing or cancelling</h3><p>You can reschedule up to three times, at least 24 hours before the slot. For washes and other short jobs, cancelling is free until 4 hours before the start; after that, Rs 100 applies. For bigger services (coatings, paint protection film, garage repairs and inspections, mods and wraps), cancelling is free until 24 hours before the start; after that, 20% of the booking total applies. Once work on your car has started, an advance you paid is not refunded. If we cancel, you get a full refund or a free reschedule. Refunds go to your original payment method in 5 to 7 working days, and any cancellation fee is taken from the refund. If you miss your slot, the booking stays valid that day during studio hours. At close (7 pm Sunday, 9 pm other days), unarrived bookings are auto-cancelled. You can make a new booking any time.</p></div>
    <div><h3>Hours</h3><p>Mon to Sat, 10 am to 9 pm. Sunday, 10 am to 7 pm.</p></div>
    <div><h3>Pickup and drop</h3><p>Pickup and drop is the same for every service. It costs Rs 100 for each leg under 3 km from the studio, and Rs 150 for each leg from 3 km (pickup and drop-off are separate legs). Distance is measured in a straight line from the studio, so the road may be longer. A Club free pickup covers the whole fee.</p></div>
    <div><h3>Payments and invoices</h3><p>You can pay at the studio or online. Online payments are processed by Razorpay. You get an invoice for each completed job. Refunds, where due, go back to the original payment method.</p></div>
    <div><h3>Club plans</h3><p>Every Club plan lasts 30 days from the day it starts. A plan gives a set number of washes and pickups for the price shown when you buy. Washes and pickups belong to your account, so you can use them for any car in your garage. They are used through the app. Unused washes and pickups end when the plan ends. They do not carry over to a renewal or to an upgrade. If you upgrade, your current plan ends when the upgrade is paid and the new plan starts fresh for 30 days.</p></div>
    <div><h3>Warranty</h3><p>Some services carry a warranty from AutoDeck. The terms are on your warranty record under your car in Garage. A warranty covers workmanship and the product named on that record. It does not cover damage from accidents, misuse, harsh chemicals or unapproved repairs, or normal wear. To claim, contact the studio with your warranty record. We inspect the car and tell you if the claim is covered.</p></div>
    <div><h3>Your car and belongings</h3><p>We take reasonable care of your car while it is with us. Please remove valuables before drop-off; we are not responsible for items left in the car. If we find damage that was already there, we tell you and note it at drop-off. If our work damages your car, we repair it or compensate you, up to the value of the work on that booking, unless the law requires more.</p></div>
    <div><h3>Cars for sale</h3><p>If you list a car in the app, the studio reviews it before other customers see it. You confirm that you own the car and the details are true. Your phone number is shown only to the studio. AutoDeck is not a party to a sale between buyer and seller.</p></div>
    <div><h3>Using the app</h3><p>Do not misuse the app, try to break it, or use it for anything unlawful. We may suspend an account that does.</p></div>
    <div><h3>Contact</h3><p>Call or WhatsApp <a class="link" href="tel:+919898679711">+91 98986 79711</a>, or write to <a class="link" href="mailto:autodeckstudio@gmail.com">autodeckstudio@gmail.com</a>.</p></div>
    <div><h3>Changes</h3><p>We may update these terms. The latest version is shown in the app.</p></div>
    <div><h3>Law</h3><p>These terms follow Indian law. Courts in Ahmedabad, Gujarat have jurisdiction.</p></div>
    </div></section>
</Base>
